WEBVTT

00:17.150 --> 00:20.220
<b>Kumehachi of Kobusa,
this is the Arson Theft Control!</b>

00:20.350 --> 00:22.120
<b>Obey our orders!</b>

00:25.320 --> 00:26.590
<b>Your comrades left you.</b>

01:35.560 --> 01:37.730
<b>Tanbei of Chigashira</b>

01:46.100 --> 01:49.840
<b>-A tenacious fellow.
-He'd rather suffer the torture.</b>

01:50.170 --> 01:51.670
<b>I'll take care of him.</b>

01:52.370 --> 01:54.740
<b>So you're Kumehachi of Kobusa?</b>

01:58.610 --> 02:03.690
<b>I'm Heizo Hasegawa,
the chief of Arson Theft Control.</b>

02:05.450 --> 02:08.660
<b>What a great honor, chief.</b>

02:09.260 --> 02:10.590
<b>It's quite an achievement for me.</b>

02:10.730 --> 02:14.860
<b>Heard you were abandoned
by your comrades</b>

02:15.200 --> 02:17.600
<b>and left behind alone.</b>

02:17.730 --> 02:21.570
<b>What's making you stay loyal
to your traitors?</b>

02:22.670 --> 02:24.710
<b>Us thieves have our own</b>

02:25.410 --> 02:29.310
<b>sense of duties and pride, chief.</b>

02:51.300 --> 02:54.400
<b>Kumehachi, you can't give up yet.</b>

02:55.470 --> 03:00.840
<b>Compared to all the things you've done,
this must be painless.</b>

03:36.250 --> 03:38.450
<b>Ojun!</b>

03:39.350 --> 03:41.920
<b>You're not allowed to be in here.</b>

03:42.250 --> 03:46.460
<b>You'll get me in big trouble.
Good grief.</b>

03:59.370 --> 04:03.510
<b>I can't even go to the toilet
without getting in trouble.</b>

04:03.640 --> 04:06.440
<b>Excuse me, sir.</b>

04:06.580 --> 04:09.650
<b>-What?
-Who was that girl?</b>

04:09.780 --> 04:13.850
<b>The chief's daughter. Although,</b>

04:14.820 --> 04:17.750
<b>not a biological one.</b>

04:17.890 --> 04:20.790
<b>She's the child of a thief he arrested.</b>

04:20.920 --> 04:23.030
<b>What...?</b>

04:23.360 --> 04:26.900
<b>Chief has a magnanimous heart.</b>

04:33.370 --> 04:37.040
<b>Heizo...Hasegawa.</b>

04:44.710 --> 04:46.720
<b>A few months later</b>

04:51.320 --> 04:53.320
<b>Sounded like a nightmare.</b>

04:55.360 --> 04:56.730
<b>Do your wounds hurt?</b>

04:59.560 --> 05:01.930
<b>Join me for a drink.</b>

05:04.330 --> 05:08.070
<b>-Where's your hometown?
-Who knows.</b>

05:08.400 --> 05:11.710
<b>I can't even recognize my parents.</b>

05:11.840 --> 05:14.080
<b>-But...
-But?</b>

05:14.410 --> 05:18.680
<b>I have a feeling that I was born
in a region way up north.</b>

05:18.810 --> 05:21.680
<b>It was a snowy, small town.</b>

05:21.820 --> 05:24.550
<b>-Snow, eh?
-There,</b>

05:24.690 --> 05:28.490
<b>I was living with a woman
I called "Grandma."</b>

05:28.620 --> 05:32.960
<b>-Grandma, eh?
-Now that I think about it,</b>

05:33.100 --> 05:36.400
<b>I have a feeling
that she really was my grandmother.</b>

05:36.530 --> 05:41.000
<b>-I see.
-One snowy day,</b>

05:41.640 --> 05:45.370
<b>Grandmother was leading me by her hand.</b>

05:48.980 --> 05:52.680
<b>Someone found me crying,
clinging on to her body.</b>

05:52.820 --> 05:55.980
<b>They took me away from her.</b>

05:56.120 --> 05:58.850
<b>I don't know what went on after that.</b>

05:58.990 --> 06:01.490
<b>By the time I was aware,</b>

06:01.620 --> 06:03.490
<b>I was making a living by</b>

06:03.630 --> 06:07.560
<b>entertaining people by walking on ropes
with the Gindayu Yamadori troupe.</b>

06:07.700 --> 06:10.770
<b>Since I didn't know my parents' faces,</b>

06:10.900 --> 06:14.870
<b>I resented my life as human.</b>

06:15.000 --> 06:20.110
<b>That's when I chose the path of evil.</b>

06:20.440 --> 06:23.110
<b>Need I say more?</b>

06:26.150 --> 06:28.520
<b>It's getting cold.</b>

06:31.790 --> 06:35.420
<b>You'll sleep better with this.</b>

06:46.770 --> 06:48.400
<b>Hey, Kumehachi.</b>

06:49.170 --> 06:52.410
<b>I don't know my mother's face either.</b>

06:53.710 --> 06:55.840
<b>Grandma, huh?</b>

06:55.980 --> 06:59.820
<b>I wish someone had led me by their hand.</b>

07:28.940 --> 07:33.220
<b>-How was it?
-It's nothing but a disaster in there.</b>

07:33.550 --> 07:36.120
<b>-Did you see the wooden tag?
-Yeah.</b>

07:36.450 --> 07:39.120
<b>It's Tanbei of Chigashira.</b>

07:39.450 --> 07:42.890
<b>He's a terrible disgrace to thieves.</b>

07:43.030 --> 07:46.130
<b>-What are his ways?
-What ways?</b>

07:46.460 --> 07:48.100
<b>He'll use every trick in the book.</b>

07:48.230 --> 07:52.100
<b>He threatens the master, steals his money</b>

07:52.230 --> 07:55.140
<b>and proceeds to slaughter all the women
and children.</b>

07:55.470 --> 07:58.010
<b>What ever happened
to the quality of thieves these days?</b>

07:58.140 --> 08:00.640
<b>Any rascal can pull off</b>

08:00.780 --> 08:02.850
<b>a violent burglary by force.</b>

08:02.980 --> 08:06.050
<b>Raping women and slaughtering people</b>

08:06.180 --> 08:09.690
<b>are violations of a true thief.</b>

08:09.820 --> 08:12.550
<b>But that's a second-hand opinion of yours,
chief.</b>

08:12.690 --> 08:14.220
<b>Please hear me out!</b>

08:20.000 --> 08:24.770
<b>-You'd like to discuss something with me?
-Yes, Mr. Hasegawa.</b>

08:24.900 --> 08:27.640
<b>Those thieves robbing your territory</b>

08:27.770 --> 08:31.040
<b>are imposters of Tanbei of Chigashira!</b>

08:31.170 --> 08:34.610
<b>-What?
-The real Tanbei</b>

08:34.740 --> 08:39.750
<b>would never in his life carry out
such a gruesome act.</b>

08:39.880 --> 08:43.150
<b>Are you familiar with the real Tanbei?</b>

08:43.290 --> 08:45.990
<b>Yes, he took care of me</b>

08:46.120 --> 08:48.160
<b>until I was 19.</b>

08:48.290 --> 08:50.760
<b>I'm indebted to the man, my former boss.</b>

08:50.890 --> 08:52.690
<b>Really?</b>

08:52.830 --> 08:57.600
<b>The one who hammered the three articles
of a true thief into me</b>

08:57.730 --> 08:59.570
<b>was Chigashira.</b>

09:00.540 --> 09:02.770
<b>Three articles of a true thief.</b>

09:02.910 --> 09:04.170
<b>Eh?</b>

09:11.710 --> 09:15.020
<b>Listen up, all of you!
While we're villains,</b>

09:15.150 --> 09:17.020
<b>we're not just thieves.</b>

09:17.150 --> 09:19.820
<b>The three articles of a true thief!</b>

09:19.960 --> 09:22.930
<b>Never forget these three rules.</b>

09:23.060 --> 09:25.560
<b>We shall never kill,</b>

09:25.690 --> 09:28.130
<b>never steal from the poor,</b>

09:28.260 --> 09:31.030
<b>and never rape women.</b>

09:31.170 --> 09:33.140
<b>We know that, chief!</b>

09:33.270 --> 09:36.710
<b>I'm getting sick of hearing it!</b>

09:36.840 --> 09:39.040
<b>-Kumehachi!
-Oh?</b>

09:45.850 --> 09:48.680
<b>Here's a drink to your pledge!</b>

09:55.260 --> 09:57.360
<b>It's good to have you here.</b>

10:15.980 --> 10:18.150
<b>But a few years later,</b>

10:18.280 --> 10:22.020
<b>I violated a moral code.</b>

10:22.150 --> 10:25.020
<b>It was a youthful discretion.</b>

10:36.830 --> 10:40.140
<b>-And then?
-I was excommunicated.</b>

10:40.270 --> 10:43.410
<b>No matter how much I begged
for forgiveness, he refused.</b>

10:43.740 --> 10:45.240
<b>But ever since that day,</b>

10:45.370 --> 10:50.280
<b>I chose to live by abiding by the three articles
of a true thief myself.</b>

10:51.410 --> 10:54.380
<b>The Tanbei of Chigashira you know</b>

10:54.720 --> 10:56.890
<b>is a true thief.</b>

10:58.150 --> 10:59.690
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

11:03.060 --> 11:05.830
<b>Chief, they've attacked again.</b>

11:05.960 --> 11:09.330
<b>This time it's the paper wholesaler
in the third district of Kojimachi,</b>

11:09.660 --> 11:11.430
<b>merchant Hikozaemon's shop.</b>

11:12.200 --> 11:14.240
<b>Another massacre?</b>

11:14.370 --> 11:18.810
<b>Well, there's one girl who survived.</b>

11:20.710 --> 11:24.380
<b>So you got away by pretending
to be dead?</b>

11:24.710 --> 11:28.350
<b>-Yes.
-You must've been terrified.</b>

11:28.680 --> 11:29.990
<b>But you're in safe hands now.</b>

11:30.450 --> 11:34.260
<b>Can you remember anything about them?</b>

11:34.990 --> 11:38.690
<b>They said,
"Now it's time to say goodbye to Edo."</b>

11:38.830 --> 11:41.060
<b>The thieves said that?</b>

11:41.200 --> 11:46.270
<b>Yes. "Listen, we're all gathering
at Shimada Lodge."</b>

11:46.400 --> 11:48.170
<b>Shimada Lodge?</b>

11:48.970 --> 11:50.770
<b>And you're sure of that?</b>

11:51.770 --> 11:55.140
<b>Please, avenge my parents.</b>

11:57.910 --> 11:59.480
<b>Mr. Yoriki.</b>

11:59.820 --> 12:02.050
<b>Please tell me one thing.</b>

12:02.180 --> 12:05.450
<b>Did you find a branded wooden tag
there too?</b>

12:11.760 --> 12:13.300
<b>Tanbei of Chigashira</b>

12:13.430 --> 12:15.460
<b>This is unforgivable.</b>

12:16.830 --> 12:18.430
<b>Chief Hasegawa,</b>

12:18.770 --> 12:21.500
<b>will you please let me capture</b>

12:21.840 --> 12:25.070
<b>this imposter of Tanbei of Chigashira?</b>

12:27.340 --> 12:29.880
<b>Kumehachi...</b>

12:30.010 --> 12:33.080
<b>even if that means you'll be known
as a dirty dog</b>

12:33.220 --> 12:37.190
<b>-among other thieves?
-But...</b>

12:37.320 --> 12:42.190
<b>I can't let this imposter
keep on disgracing the great Tanbei!</b>

12:43.130 --> 12:46.190
<b>This is all part of the code.</b>

12:47.400 --> 12:51.130
<b>I promise that I'll return
when I fulfill my assignment.</b>

12:53.870 --> 12:56.140
<b>Hold on, chief.</b>

12:56.270 --> 12:59.910
<b>It's unheard of to release a captive thief.</b>

13:00.040 --> 13:03.250
<b>It's a serious matter if he escapes.</b>

13:03.380 --> 13:05.080
<b>I understand that.</b>

13:05.210 --> 13:07.820
<b>You might be dismissed too, chief.</b>

13:07.950 --> 13:10.950
<b>Are you sure you want
to let Kumehachi out?</b>

13:11.090 --> 13:14.360
<b>Sajima, we can trust him.</b>

13:14.490 --> 13:16.190
<b>Chief...</b>

13:16.320 --> 13:18.830
<b>If my way is proven to be ineffective,</b>

13:19.790 --> 13:22.060
<b>I'll gladly give up my life.</b>

13:29.470 --> 13:33.070
<b>Shimada Lodge</b>

13:45.590 --> 13:47.390
<b>Hey bastards!</b>

13:48.990 --> 13:50.830
<b>How can I help you, kiddo?</b>

13:51.890 --> 13:54.500
<b>You'll die young if you put on airs like that.</b>

14:07.910 --> 14:12.080
<b>What's wrong? Looks like you're the one
who's gonna die young.</b>

14:12.210 --> 14:14.920
<b>I... I was kidding.</b>

14:18.450 --> 14:21.160
<b>If you have a problem,
come to me any time!</b>

14:21.290 --> 14:24.390
<b>I'll be waiting at an inn called Suzuya!</b>

14:25.090 --> 14:28.400
<b>Arson Theft Control
temporary office</b>

14:31.170 --> 14:34.400
<b>-Any updates?
-Well, unfortunately,</b>

14:34.540 --> 14:36.500
<b>there's no sign of thieves whatsoever.</b>

14:37.340 --> 14:40.540
<b>Sakai and Koyanagi are shadowing
Kumehachi right now.</b>

14:40.880 --> 14:45.410
<b>Chief, those words the girl heard...</b>

14:45.550 --> 14:48.880
<b>How they're supposed to gather
at Shimada Lodge...</b>

14:49.020 --> 14:51.920
<b>-Do you really think it's true?
-Chugo, what?!</b>

14:52.050 --> 14:57.160
<b>Well, there's the possibility
that she heard wrong.</b>

14:59.030 --> 15:02.360
<b>True, we've been at Shimada Lodge
for ten days now.</b>

15:02.500 --> 15:07.340
<b>It might be time for us to withdraw soon.</b>

15:37.000 --> 15:40.400
<b>Hey, I've got a visitor here for you.</b>

15:41.570 --> 15:43.100
<b>Who can that be?</b>

15:44.370 --> 15:47.110
<b>I know you're standing right there.</b>

15:48.540 --> 15:52.010
<b>Kumehachi, it's been a while.</b>

15:55.720 --> 15:58.550
<b>Chief?!</b>

16:05.230 --> 16:08.230
<b>It's been 15 years, eh?</b>

16:08.360 --> 16:09.600
<b>Indeed.</b>

16:09.730 --> 16:14.300
<b>What business do you have here,
Kumehachi?</b>

16:14.440 --> 16:18.670
<b>I've botched things up and ran from Edo,</b>

16:19.010 --> 16:21.580
<b>but I had no place to go.</b>

16:21.710 --> 16:24.410
<b>I ended up staying here at Shimada
for a while.</b>

16:24.550 --> 16:28.050
<b>Botched things up?
Who were you serving?</b>

16:28.180 --> 16:31.420
<b>Nobody. It was my own foolish doing.</b>

16:31.550 --> 16:33.150
<b>Is that so?</b>

16:37.530 --> 16:40.560
<b>Then I suppose you've heard rumors</b>

16:40.700 --> 16:43.370
<b>about my recent doings too, eh?</b>

16:44.530 --> 16:46.700
<b>A massacre is a must for a robbery.</b>

16:47.040 --> 16:49.070
<b>It's impossible to be traced!</b>

16:49.200 --> 16:52.410
<b>-But...
-The wooden tags?</b>

16:52.540 --> 16:56.580
<b>I'm only making fun of the Arson Theft
Control.</b>

16:56.710 --> 17:00.010
<b>None of them are familiar with my face.</b>

17:00.150 --> 17:02.650
<b>How about the three articles
of a true thief?</b>

17:02.780 --> 17:07.020
<b>Hey, I used to preach that a long time ago!</b>

17:07.160 --> 17:10.060
<b>It was one of those youthful indiscretions!</b>

17:10.190 --> 17:12.490
<b>How could you recall</b>

17:12.630 --> 17:15.400
<b>such a trivial thing?</b>

17:18.570 --> 17:23.300
<b>What do you think, Kumehachi?
Why don't you come back?</b>

17:24.540 --> 17:29.110
<b>Come back and work for me.
But I'm not trying to be pushy here.</b>

17:30.550 --> 17:31.550
<b>Yes.</b>

17:31.780 --> 17:35.150
<b>Good! I'm glad to hear!</b>

17:35.280 --> 17:38.250
<b>You'd be a tremendous asset!</b>

17:38.390 --> 17:41.390
<b>All right! Let's drink to your pledge!</b>

17:42.790 --> 17:44.330
<b>Drink up!</b>

17:46.800 --> 17:50.230
<b>Come to Mikuraya tomorrow.</b>

17:50.370 --> 17:53.640
<b>The tobacco shop in the seventh district
is my hideout.</b>

17:55.440 --> 17:59.340
<b>All right! Make sure you take care
of that lady.</b>

18:21.400 --> 18:22.630
<b>Who is this?</b>

18:23.670 --> 18:25.270
<b>Tomorrow's another rainy day.</b>

18:28.540 --> 18:29.570
<b>It's a raid!</b>

18:30.240 --> 18:31.640
<b>This is the Arson Theft Control!</b>

18:31.840 --> 18:33.580
<b>You're all arrested!</b>

18:35.310 --> 18:39.210
<b>Offenders like you deserve no time
for a verdict!</b>

18:39.350 --> 18:41.220
<b>If you resist, you will die!</b>

19:23.590 --> 19:25.160
<b>Bastard...</b>

19:29.860 --> 19:34.770
<b>-A filthy traitor!
-You're the fake Tanbei of Chigashira!</b>

19:35.770 --> 19:38.410
<b>Enter the prison gates now!</b>

19:38.540 --> 19:40.740
<b>What?! Are you crazy?</b>

19:40.880 --> 19:45.580
<b>-Me? An imposter?!
-You heard me.</b>

19:45.710 --> 19:48.550
<b>The Tanbei I know</b>

19:49.650 --> 19:52.790
<b>isn't a filthy bastard like you.</b>

19:58.760 --> 20:01.830
<b>Hey, wait a minute...!</b>

20:02.560 --> 20:04.330
<b>Hey!</b>

20:04.470 --> 20:06.970
<b>You're sure he's an imposter?</b>

20:07.300 --> 20:09.340
<b>-Yes.
-You bastard!</b>

20:09.470 --> 20:11.640
<b>The real one isn't a disgrace.</b>

20:11.770 --> 20:14.540
<b>-He's an imposter...
-How about some gratitude, eh?</b>

20:14.680 --> 20:15.940
<b>He's an imposter.</b>

20:16.910 --> 20:18.650
<b>You're gonna regret this!</b>

20:22.550 --> 20:24.220
<b>Kumehachi.</b>

20:25.920 --> 20:29.990
<b>Why don't you work for me as a spy?</b>

20:30.330 --> 20:32.930
<b>But I'm sure you might not like that idea.</b>

20:33.960 --> 20:37.330
<b>You'd be a great asset to our organization.</b>

20:38.500 --> 20:42.270
<b>Come to my government house
once you resolve yourself.</b>

20:51.310 --> 20:53.550
<b>I'm back.</b>

20:53.680 --> 20:55.980
<b>Oh, I'm exhausted.</b>

20:56.320 --> 20:58.490
<b>Mother, I'm starving.</b>

20:58.620 --> 21:00.960
<b>Where are your manners, Tatsuzo?</b>

21:03.760 --> 21:05.260
<b>Father!</b>

21:06.760 --> 21:09.760
<b>Thank you for all the work you do.</b>

21:11.800 --> 21:14.300
<b>I'm glad to hear that you caught the villain</b>

21:14.440 --> 21:16.300
<b>who's been causing trouble
all over town!</b>

21:16.840 --> 21:20.610
<b>I'm just returning from training at the dojo.</b>

21:21.040 --> 21:22.280
<b>I see.</b>

21:26.450 --> 21:28.350
<b>I wonder if your older brother</b>

21:28.480 --> 21:31.720
<b>is serious about his training, Ojun.</b>

21:31.850 --> 21:33.450
<b>Of course I am!</b>

21:33.590 --> 21:35.960
<b>See? My arms are bigger!</b>

21:36.960 --> 21:38.360
<b>That hurt!</b>

21:39.490 --> 21:42.530
<b>-Chink in the armor! She got you there.
-What?!</b>

21:42.730 --> 21:43.730
<b>Tatsuzo!</b>

21:43.900 --> 21:46.600
<b>How did you get this stain?</b>

21:48.300 --> 21:49.740
<b>Well...</b>

21:49.870 --> 21:53.040
<b>It's blood. Must be from my bloody nose.</b>

21:53.370 --> 21:56.610
<b>What about the smell of face powder?</b>

21:56.740 --> 21:59.550
<b>Hey! Father, come on.</b>

21:59.680 --> 22:01.820
<b>-It is almost spring.
-What?!</b>

22:01.950 --> 22:04.520
<b>-One must enjoy themselves.
-Oh, my.</b>

22:04.650 --> 22:05.820
<b>Father!</b>

22:07.960 --> 22:09.720
<b>Ojun!</b>

22:20.970 --> 22:27.110
<b>People are creatures born from dreams</b>

22:27.440 --> 22:32.980
<b>How can the sky look so blue?</b>

22:33.110 --> 22:38.950
<b>The past and future are just short-lived moments</b>

22:39.420 --> 22:44.760
<b>that exist between the blink of an eye</b>

22:47.730 --> 22:49.960
<b>Oh time…</b>

22:50.100 --> 22:53.970
<b>I could be a flower of spring</b>

22:54.100 --> 22:59.010
<b>in my next life</b>

22:59.910 --> 23:04.980
<b>And then…live on</b>

23:05.850 --> 23:11.150
<b>…and then…be loved</b>

23:11.920 --> 23:14.860
<b>La la la</b>

23:20.060 --> 23:23.560
<b>And then…cry</b>

23:26.870 --> 23:32.870
<b>…and then…fall</b>

23:41.480 --> 23:45.820
<b>Heizo reunites with his old friend at Honjo</b>

23:45.990 --> 23:49.990
<b>Their fond memories and bitter present cross</b>

23:50.630 --> 23:52.090
<b>Next Episode
Onihei</b>

23:52.430 --> 23:53.560
<b>Honjo, Sakura Estate</b>

23:53.690 --> 23:54.700
<b>Honjo, Sakura Estate</b>
